        "IsBlock": null,
        "IsEnd": null,
        "BeginAnim": "DialogEnable",
        "EndAnim": null,
        "BeginDelay": null,
        "EndDelay": null,
        "Params": "{3: 'On a nearby table, black and white pieces are nicely arranged on the chessboard, and the one who set them up is napping on the sofa.'}"
    },
    {
        "Id": 9,
        "ActionId": 9,
        "NextActionId": null,
        "Type": 301,
        "IsBlock": null,
        "IsEnd": null,
        "BeginAnim": null,
        "EndAnim": null,
        "BeginDelay": null,
        "EndDelay": null,
        "Params": "{3: 'While sleep is not a necessity for Constructs, it is an effective way to stabilize their M.I.N.D.s.'}"
    },
    {
        "Id": 10,
        "ActionId": 10,
        "NextActionId": null,
        "Type": 301,
        "IsBlock": null,
        "IsEnd": null,
        "BeginAnim": null,
        "EndAnim": null,
        "BeginDelay": null,
        "EndDelay": null,
        "Params": "{3: \"As the captain of a scout team that is constantly on the move and one of Task Force's elites, Chrome has reduced rest to little more than a footnote in his life. It is rare for you to catch him with his guard down.\"}"
    },
    {
        "Id": 11,
        "ActionId": 11,
        "NextActionId": null,
        "Type": 301,
        "IsBlock": null,
        "IsEnd": null,
        "BeginAnim": null,
        "EndAnim": "DialogDisable",
        "BeginDelay": null,
        "EndDelay": null,
        "Params": "{3: 'You are reluctant to disturb his hard-earned rest. After all, you were the one who made him waste his precious break waiting for you in the first place.'}"
    },
    {
        "Id": 12,
        "ActionId": 12,
        "NextActionId": null,
